<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/cursor') %>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="audit-hero services-hero">
    <div class="audit-hero-content reveal">
      <span class="cs-hero-eyebrow">Services</span>
      <h1 class="cs-hero-title">What We Do</h1>
      <p class="audit-hero-sub">Cinematic production paired with data-driven YouTube strategy. Two services, one studio.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── VIDEO PRODUCTION ── -->
  <section class="services-section services-section-dark">
    <div class="services-inner reveal">
      <span class="services-eyebrow">01</span>
      <h2 class="services-heading">Video Production</h2>
      <div class="services-intro">
        <p>We shoot on the Nikon Z cinema line — chosen for its colour science, reliability, and ability to deliver premium imagery at scale. This allows us to maintain a consistent, film-grade visual identity across brand documentaries, YouTube series, commercial content, and short-form executions.</p>
        <p>Alongside Nikon, we align creatively with RED as a cinematic benchmark. By blending high-end cinema tools with YouTube-first strategy, we bridge the gap between film and digital — delivering content that feels premium, intentional, and built for scale.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="services-media-placeholder">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline>
          <source src="/videos/bs_studios_services_loop.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>

      <div class="services-features-grid">
        <div class="services-feature">
          <h3 class="services-feature-title">Retention-First Scripting</h3>
          <p class="services-feature-desc">The first 3–5 seconds determine the ROI of the entire project. We prioritise retention engineering from the very first frame.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-feature">
          <h3 class="services-feature-title">High-End Visual Identity</h3>
          <p class="services-feature-desc">Standardised lighting setups and colour grading LUTs that give every client a premium, cinematic look without starting from scratch.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-feature">
          <h3 class="services-feature-title">Native Vertical Strategy</h3>
          <p class="services-feature-desc">Production days are blocked to capture 9:16 vertical content natively — not cropped from 16:9, which looks cheap to high-end brands.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-feature">
          <h3 class="services-feature-title">Search & Intent Optimisation</h3>
          <p class="services-feature-desc">YouTube is the world's second-largest search engine. Your production isn't finished until it's findable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-feature">
          <h3 class="services-feature-title">Advanced Sound Design</h3>
          <p class="services-feature-desc">Professional-grade lav mics, 32-bit audio capture, and Dolby-quality sound design as standard across every production.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-feature">
          <h3 class="services-feature-title">Modular Editing</h3>
          <p class="services-feature-desc">Custom workflows, templates, and presets for graphics, lower thirds, and CTAs. Bespoke quality at systematised speeds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-feature">
          <h3 class="services-feature-title">Thumbnail & CTR A/B Testing</h3>
          <p class="services-feature-desc">Monthly retention audits with YouTube Studio data — showing exactly why people dropped off and how we fix it on the next shoot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-feature">
          <h3 class="services-feature-title">Interactive Elements & CTA Strategy</h3>
          <p class="services-feature-desc">Systematically placed end screens, cards, and pinned comments to drive viewers from video to website or booking page.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="services-cta-wrap">
        <a href="/contact" class="services-cta">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── YOUTUBE STRATEGY ── -->
  <section class="services-section services-section-strategy">
    <div class="services-inner reveal">
      <span class="services-eyebrow">02</span>
      <h2 class="services-heading">YouTube Strategy</h2>
      <div class="services-intro">
        <p>Data-driven YouTube strategy for creators, brands, and businesses who are serious about growth. Choose the tier that fits where you are — we'll handle the rest.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Placeholder for video loop / visual -->
      <div class="services-media-placeholder">
        <div class="services-media-inner">
          <span class="services-media-label">Strategy Overview</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="services-tiers">
        <!-- Foundation -->
        <div class="services-tier-card services-tier-foundation">
          <span class="services-tier-number">Tier 1</span>
          <h3 class="services-tier-name">Foundation</h3>
          <p class="services-tier-tagline">Your strategic launchpad.</p>
          <ul class="services-tier-list">
            <li>Channel Blueprint & setup</li>
            <li>Monthly content roadmap</li>
            <li>Full upload optimisation for search</li>
            <li>Managed posting via YouTube permissions — no passwords needed</li>
            <li>Path to YouTube Partner Programme</li>
            <li>Channel positioned as a portfolio sponsors and brands take seriously</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="services-tier-cta">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Growth & Management -->
        <div class="services-tier-card services-tier-growth">
          <span class="services-tier-number">Tier 2</span>
          <h3 class="services-tier-name">Growth & Management</h3>
          <p class="services-tier-tagline">You create. We handle the rest.</p>
          <p class="services-tier-includes">Everything in Foundation, plus:</p>
          <ul class="services-tier-list">
            <li>Dedicated channel manager</li>
            <li>Sponsorship outreach</li>
            <li>4× YouTube Shorts edited per month</li>
            <li>Community & engagement management</li>
            <li>Deep analytics & strategy reporting</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="services-tier-cta">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Partnership -->
        <div class="services-tier-card services-tier-premium">
          <span class="services-tier-number">Tier 3</span>
          <h3 class="services-tier-name">Partnership</h3>
          <p class="services-tier-tagline">Full-service production partnership.</p>
          <p class="services-tier-includes">Everything in Growth & Management, plus:</p>
          <ul class="services-tier-list">
            <li>Professional long-form editing</li>
            <li>Batch-filming strategy</li>
            <li>Multi-platform distribution — LinkedIn, Instagram, TikTok & X</li>
            <li>ROI reporting tied to business goals</li>
            <li>Fortnightly strategy calls</li>
            <li>Dedicated account management</li>
            <li>Custom branding packages</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="services-tier-cta services-tier-cta-premium">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/signup') %>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
